            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KeelyDavison"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband and I really like this recipe. It is a take on regular fried rice, and really does have a Malaysian flavor. I almost always use the vegetables suggested, but find that you can use a variety of veggies.",
            "datePublished": "2011-02-24T16:43:31.620Z"
