            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gastronome"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This turned out very tasty. I took the advice of others that tried this recipe and 1) omitted the brown sugar and 2) used garlic chili sauce instead of sweet chili sauce. The recipe is still a bit sweet due to the ketchup (yes, ketchup...can you believe it?). We loved it and will keep it as a mainstay in our house.\nThanks for sharing this yummy recipe!",
